(6758178, 1011786, 10785, '<td valign="top">To me, this shot is a very good example of repetition or rhythm, but it just doesn''t have the curve or twisted vibe. I am finding it hard to see how this fits the challenge, other than that the dimples are round. The balls are all lined up in a straight line pattern as well so... The balls are coming off really grey when they should be nice and white. Otherwise everything is nice and sharp with good focus and good use of depth of field.</td>', 'To me, this shot is a very good example of repetition or rhythm, but it just doesn''t have the curve or twisted vibe. I am finding it hard to see how this fits the challenge, other than that the dimples are round. The balls are all lined up in a straight line pattern as well so... The balls are coming off really grey when they should be nice and white. Otherwise everything is nice and sharp with good focus and good use of depth of field.', '2012-05-02 20:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
