(6760914, 1013164, 135629, '<td valign="top">I love the pictures in these caves with light, this is almost there. Lighting could be a lot better as you have deep black shadows and the white on the ground where the sun hits is blown out, great shooting area with more practice in this spot you could turn some high scoring shots. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I love the pictures in these caves with light, this is almost there. Lighting could be a lot better as you have deep black shadows and the white on the ground where the sun hits is blown out, great shooting area with more practice in this spot you could turn some high scoring shots. Good luck in the challenge.', '2012-05-06 10:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
