(6762298, 1012273, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like it this way, but like it even better in the original rotation. I think the light works better.</td>', 'I like it this way, but like it even better in the original rotation. I think the light works better.', '2012-05-07 17:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
