(6763269, 1013096, 49954, '<td valign="top">Nice work... don''t mind borders, but the yellow strip distracts...  Suggest in the future add a 1px black line, then a 1px complimentary color, then the remaining black border.  You may disagree.  6</td>', 'Nice work... don''t mind borders, but the yellow strip distracts...  Suggest in the future add a 1px black line, then a 1px complimentary color, then the remaining black border.  You may disagree.  6', '2012-05-08 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
