(6763507, 1013192, 113278, '<td valign="top">Wow, my favorite of the challenge. Love the motion and colors.</td>', 'Wow, my favorite of the challenge. Love the motion and colors.', '2012-05-08 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6763547, 1013128, 10785, '<td valign="top">Your submission is a little small and could be improved by using the full width and height of pixels allowed. I get the reference to twisted with their being no straight lines in the clouds, however it is not a very strong subject for the challenge.</td>', 'Your submission is a little small and could be improved by using the full width and height of pixels allowed. I get the reference to twisted with their being no straight lines in the clouds, however it is not a very strong subject for the challenge.', '2012-05-08 15:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6763551, 1012844, 10785, '<td valign="top">Interesting take. I think the lights represent the subject well, however it just seems very random. The lines are not really leading to anything of interest so there is no strong focal point in the shot. Also the shutter may have been open a hair long since the background is more browny grey than black. I guess that is neither here nor there.</td>', 'Interesting take. I think the lights represent the subject well, however it just seems very random. The lines are not really leading to anything of interest so there is no strong focal point in the shot. Also the shutter may have been open a hair long since the background is more browny grey than black. I guess that is neither here nor there.', '2012-05-08 15:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6763554, 1012146, 10785, '<td valign="top">Funny take on the challenge!</td>', 'Funny take on the challenge!', '2012-05-08 15:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6763558, 1013122, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge. Due to the very diffuse nature of the light, there doesn''t appear to be much if any contrast in the shot which would add some much needed depth to the subject. I think possibly backing up a little and shooting from slightly farther away with more of the pasta in the frame may have helped. From this distance, the imperfections in the pasta noodles really stand out.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge. Due to the very diffuse nature of the light, there doesn''t appear to be much if any contrast in the shot which would add some much needed depth to the subject. I think possibly backing up a little and shooting from slightly farther away with more of the pasta in the frame may have helped. From this distance, the imperfections in the pasta noodles really stand out.', '2012-05-08 15:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6763561, 1013156, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good arrangement and very good light makes this nice and bright with good contrast for depth. This again reminds me of a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=48228" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">sherpet</a> image.</td>', 'Good arrangement and very good light makes this nice and bright with good contrast for depth. This again reminds me of a  sherpet image.', '2012-05-08 15:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6763562, 1012711, 10785, '<td valign="top">Though overall the shot is very grey and lacking in tonal range, the composition is very good with the curving lines and use of camera rotation.</td>', 'Though overall the shot is very grey and lacking in tonal range, the composition is very good with the curving lines and use of camera rotation.', '2012-05-08 15:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6763563, 1012479, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great texture and shape with the people reflected adding interest.</td>', 'Great texture and shape with the people reflected adding interest.', '2012-05-08 15:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6763599, 1013173, 69684, '<td valign="top">This looks great!</td>', 'This looks great!', '2012-05-08 16:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
