(6766521, 1013190, 114969, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Allen, this staircase really is something, be it upwards or downwards. Great B&amp;W conversion.</td>', 'Congratulations Allen, this staircase really is something, be it upwards or downwards. Great B&W conversion.', '2012-05-11 03:58:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6766825, 1013190, 112972, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gyaban:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations Allen, this staircase really is something, be it upwards or downwards. Great B&amp;W conversion. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I think one of the reasons that makes this staircase look unique is because it is really 2 staircases intertwined with each other.  It is easier to see that from the top view on my profile page.  It has 2 entrances and 2 exits.</td>', 'Originally posted by gyaban: Congratulations Allen, this staircase really is something, be it upwards or downwards. Great B&W conversion.   I think one of the reasons that makes this staircase look unique is because it is really 2 staircases intertwined with each other.  It is easier to see that from the top view on my profile page.  It has 2 entrances and 2 exits.', '2012-05-11 12:42:14.000000', NULL, 0),
